three facts at W=13, under the Precise-widens reading:
  strategy   at-rest   compute   stride
  Warm       u16       u16       16
  Precise    u16       u32       16
  Cold       u16       u16       13

M2  slot = at-rest type   (u16, 16) for both  -> DOES NOT SEPARATE
    compiled as a must-not-refuse assertion. this is 47's arm, and it holds.

M1  slot = compute type   (u16, 16) against (u32, 16)  -> SEPARATES
    so 48's 'either way you are short one fact' is not symmetric on information.
    under M1 the pair separates, and what is missing is the at-rest TYPE, which is
    unreachable from a stride const rather than absent from the information.

both halves close, and the same wall closes them: 47 section 2.3's kind boundary.
see p5b_negctl_three_facts.rs for the two refusals.
